Hi everyone. In this video, we'll take a

2
00:00:04,240 --> 00:00:05,920
closer look at how to set up and manage

3
00:00:05,920 --> 00:00:08,080
your current schedules in Blitz. Think

4
00:00:08,080 --> 00:00:09,920
