18
00:00:39,440 --> 00:00:41,680
Every day, just like it sounds, a new

19
00:00:41,680 --> 00:00:44,000
task every day. Each Monday, seven new

20
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:45,600
tasks will be created for each day of

21
00:00:45,600 --> 00:00:48,559
the week. Every weekday, the task

22
00:00:48,559 --> 00:00:50,960
