27
00:00:59,760 --> 00:01:02,480
Monday. Every month the task repeats

28
00:01:02,480 --> 00:01:04,479
each month based on the current selected

29
00:01:04,479 --> 00:01:06,880
date. In my case, I want to be reminded

30
00:01:06,880 --> 00:01:08,960
to check emails each weekday. So I

31
00:01:08,960 --> 00:01:11,040
should select the every weekday option.

32
00:01:11,040 --> 00:01:12,640
Once you select the interval that

33
00:01:12,640 --> 00:01:14,640
matches your needs, click schedule to

34
00:01:14,640 --> 00:01:16,240
save.

35
00:01:16,240 --> 00:01:18,000
When you set a recurrent schedule, let

36
00:01:18,000 --> 00:01:19,759
it creates a parent task in your backlog

37
00:01:19,759 --> 00:01:22,320
in the recurrent tasks section. Think of

38
00:01:22,320 --> 00:01:24,240
