45
00:01:37,200 --> 00:01:39,520
weekday, one in the today column because

46
00:01:39,520 --> 00:01:41,920
it is due today and four in this week

47
00:01:41,920 --> 00:01:43,759
column.

48
00:01:43,759 --> 00:01:45,520
You can see that each task shows the day

49
00:01:45,520 --> 00:01:48,399
