50
00:01:48,399 --> 00:01:50,720
behave just like regular tasks. You can

51
00:01:50,720 --> 00:01:53,200
addit, complete, or reschedule them as

52
00:01:53,200 --> 00:01:54,880
needed.

53
00:01:54,880 --> 00:01:56,560
This system keeps your recurrent work

54
00:01:56,560 --> 00:02:00,000
organized so you never miss a bit. If

55
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:02,079
plans change, you can easily update the

56
00:02:02,079 --> 00:02:04,159
recurring schedule in the child tasks.

57
00:02:04,159 --> 00:02:06,640
Just open the tasks expanded menu,

58
00:02:06,640 --> 00:02:08,800
select update schedule, and adjust the

59
00:02:08,800 --> 00:02:11,800
settings.

60
00:02:11,840 --> 00:02:14,000
To remove a schedule, click the X icon

61
00:02:14,000 --> 00:02:16,800
next to the schedule details. As for the

62
00:02:16,800 --> 00:02:18,239
parent task, you can remove the

63
00:02:18,239 --> 00:02:19,680
