64
00:02:19,680 --> 00:02:22,080
recurring in the expanded menu. The task

65
00:02:22,080 --> 00:02:23,840
will stay in backlog, no longer making

66
00:02:23,840 --> 00:02:25,760
new child tasks, but the existing ones

67
00:02:25,760 --> 00:02:28,319
will stay where they are. The current

68
00:02:28,319 --> 00:02:29,599
shadows feature is a simple and

69
00:02:29,599 --> 00:02:31,599
effective way to boost your productivity

70
00:02:31,599 --> 00:02:34,080
and avoid the repetitive setup. Give it

71
